00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.560
Hello, Aoy and Chod.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.280
I'm Fon.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.880
I'm 34 years old.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.840
I’m an online fiction writer.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.840
I only joined this industry not long ago,

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.720
much later than most other writers.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.200
So I’ve been pouring everything into my work,

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:04.600
spending most of my days in my room, not really living life.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.800
Luckily, I found success quickly.

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:31.240
But at the same time, I lost something,

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:35.280
someone I thought I loved.

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:47.000
- What are you doing, honey? - I'm working.

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:49.240
It's the new tea. I made some for you.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:50.760
- Okay, but wait. - Try it.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.440
Wait.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:55.600
Hey. I said wait.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.760
You spilled tea on my work.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:24.800
So it made me scared to love again,

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:29.280
because I think I’m not good enough to love anyone.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:50.040
Wow, is the world ending? You’re calling me.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:53.399
Don’t overreact. I just finished a new story.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.160
Are you free to celebrate tonight?

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:59.880
Honestly, I haven’t seen you in months.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.640
Stop rambling. Are you in or out?

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.880
I want to go,

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.120
but I’m at a photoshoot. Not sure when I’ll be done.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:11.480
I’ll wait for you at the studio.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:14.160
We can go together when you’re done. No need to hurry.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:20.640
Good. That’s great. Hold on.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:24.360
Please turn to the side.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.440
Please turn to the side.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:30.160
- Okay. - This is a great angle.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.000
Exactly what we want.

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:36.599
Good, that's it. Amazing.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:39.160
- Give me a fierce look. - That's right.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:07.880
Amazing.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.880
- Beautiful. - Good job.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:14.480
All right, guys. That’s a wrap! Thank you so much.

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:16.280
Thank you.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.680
I’ll finish up inside, wait a moment.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:24.360
Excuse me.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:26.920
Are you Fon,

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:30.000
- the writer? - Yes.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.080
I'm so happy.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:35.720
Can I take a selfie with you? I want to show it to my friends.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.400
Of course.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.080
I really love your work.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.040
- I’ve read all your stories. - Really?

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:58.720
I look like someone who doesn’t read, right?

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.320
I like to read

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:07.440
because it helps me escape reality.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:11.280
My reality

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:14.120
isn’t as beautiful as in the stories.

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:19.920
If you read the latest one I just uploaded,

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:22.400
you might not like it.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:25.440
It’s based on my life,

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:27.800
which isn’t beautiful either.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:32.360
I’m actually the villain in the story.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:36.880
Do you really think I’m that good of a person?

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.080
Don’t worry.

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:47.760
I like all your stories.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:54.840
I might even like this one the most

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:58.400
because it won’t just be entertaining,

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.400
I’ll get to know you better too.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:09.120
Please excuse me. I have to change.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.480
- Hey. - What?

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.040
Do you know that girl?

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:23.920
If I hadn’t interrupted, you two would’ve fused into one by now.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:28.400
Come on, she’s just a fan who came to say hi.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:33.480
Is she a famous model or something?

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.440
