00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:46.640
She’s not your average girl.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:50.000
She’s got a reputation

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:52.120
for sleeping around.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:57.040
At least a few people in my office have slept with her.

00:06:57.320 --> 00:06:59.800
Maybe she’s been with the whole office.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:02.720
Why would she do that? For money?

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:04.320
I don’t think so.

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:08.480
She still gets booked for jobs and she’s responsible.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:11.120
That’s why she still has a career.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.120
Then she probably has her reasons.

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:18.000
What reasons does one have to sleep around?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:21.960
Wait.

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:26.639
Don’t tell me you’ve fallen for her.

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:30.760
Of course not. You know I’m not interested in dating anymore.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:34.160
I just don’t want to judge someone without getting to know them.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:40.800
There are some people you’re better off not knowing.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:44.360
Someone dangerous like her will only bring you down.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.040
- Is it that bad? - Trust me.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.880
Stop rambling. Can we go now?

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:53.120
Five minutes. No, ten. Let me save my files.

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:55.880
- I’ll wait in the car. - I won’t take long.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.280
- Let's finish this. - Okay.

00:07:58.400 --> 00:07:59.800
Right here.

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.720
Then I met her,

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.720
the woman who made my heart race again.

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:19.160
She seemed dangerous, even my friend warned me.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:23.320
But there was something about her that drew me in,

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:28.920
something that made me want to ignore all the warnings.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:40.960
(- You're so hot. - I'm your fan.)

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:56.480
But let me warn you. She’s not your average girl.

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:59.080
She’s got a reputation for sleeping around.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.440
Magical moment.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:20.200
Spying much, Ms. Writer?

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:25.640
What do you mean by that?

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:36.800
Hello.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.360
This isn’t your first time.

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:44.480
You were spying on me at the parking lot today.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.600
I saw you.

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:52.160
That's not my bae.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.960
I could tell.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.880
I just hope that isn't someone else’s bae.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:03.520
Honestly,

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:05.560
I don’t know.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.720
I didn’t think about that.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:12.480
Some things are worth thinking about.

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:17.440
The consequences of acting without thinking can be scary.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:22.080
Thanks for the warning.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:24.800
And...

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:29.480
Thanks for not minding talking to me.

